	<string id="ui_mcm_fotz_faction">
		<text>Lead a faction of your own</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_fotz_faction_desc">
		<text>Found a faction of your own. It starts with the friends and enemies of the faction you came from, and your companions join it. Turned off, it is disbanded and everyone goes back to their old faction. No save ever holds it, so removing the mod later needs nothing.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_fotz_faction_name">
		<text>Its name</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_fotz_faction_name_desc">
		<text>What your faction is called in the news.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_fotz_faction_join">
		<text>You join it</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_fotz_faction_join_desc">
		<text>Off unless you choose it: you lead your faction from your old one and keep its traders, tasks and dialogs. On, you stand in your faction yourself and its friends and enemies are yours, but G.A.M.M.A. doesn't know your faction: the disguise system thinks you're in disguise, and traders, tasks, dialogs and fast travel tied to your old faction treat you as an outsider.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_fotz_faction_companions">
		<text>Companions join it</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_fotz_faction_companions_desc">
		<text>Your companions join your faction, and leave it when they leave you.</text>
	</string>
